<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>卷六数集 - 分类 - 观颐斋</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/</link><description>观以明理，颐以养正</description><follow_challenge><feedId>150502341826627584</feedId><userId>ZnkTaajoold86nK1rOZmQsDmDM1cgXMP</userId></follow_challenge><generator>Hugo 0.161.0 &amp; FixIt v0.4.5</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</managingEditor><webMaster>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 15:11:52 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>中寒门</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-2-zhonghanmen/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 15:09:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-2-zhonghanmen/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“中寒门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;专论&lt;strong&gt;阴寒直中少阴肾经&lt;/strong&gt;的急危重症辨治法则。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;寒邪直入肾经，元阳飞越，死气弥漫，非大剂参、术、附、桂不足以追亡魂、夺阳魄。各症虽有轻重，总以峻补元气、大热回阳为救逆根本&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item><item><title>伤寒门</title><link>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-1-shanghanmen/</link><pubDate>Wed, 01 Jul 2026 10:33:52 +0800</pubDate><author>acuherb@foxmail.com (AcuHerb)</author><guid>https://acuherb.xyz/posts/6-1-shanghanmen/</guid><category domain="https://acuherb.xyz/categories/%E5%8D%B7%E5%85%AD%E6%95%B0%E9%9B%86/">卷六数集</category><description>本节为《石室秘录》“伤寒门”部分，由&lt;strong&gt;雷公真君&lt;/strong&gt;系统论述伤寒传经变证、危重症及产后感邪的辨治法则，并传系列救急奇方。核心思想是：&lt;strong&gt;伤寒危证多因正气衰微、阴阳离决，当以峻补元气、回阳救逆为主，辅以清热、散寒、祛邪、生津，于死中求生。传经有顺、过、隔、两感之别，各立主方；诸般死症，察其一线生机而力挽之&lt;/strong&gt;。</description></item></channel></rss>